// Pixel art as data: one character per pixel, '.' is clear, every other
// character is a palette key. Authored with a scratch generator, then
// committed as plain grids: edit the rows here directly.
//
// Chapter 3-2, Snell After Midnight: inside the library, quiet and warm.
// Same layout as the rooftop set so the chunk baker works unchanged: tiles
// are 16 x 16, anchor top left, each kind one anim whose frames are
// variants (fps 0, pick by column hash). roofTop is the carpet floor with
// its brass bar and oak nosing (variant 1 a pool of lamp light on the
// carpet, variant 2 a pencil left behind), roofEdgeLeft and roofEdgeRight
// its ends, roofFill the floor structure (a slab over a joist bay; variant 1
// a conduit and junction box, variant 2 a crack and a hanger rod), oneWay a
// shelf top (oak board, brass label rail, steel brackets), stone a squat
// stack block, spikes a heap of steel bookends tipped corner up over spilt
// books (hazard), brick a returns bin full of books (breakable), auraBlock
// the sigma crate in oak and brass, vent a brass heating grille in the slab,
// pipe an overhead sprinkler main with a pendant head.
//
// stacks: 16 x 16, anchor top left, 4 variant frames (fps 0) of solid book
// stack: books standing on a steel shelf lip on the bottom rows, the dark
// back of the shelf above them. Tiles seamlessly both ways. Variant 3 has a
// shelf upright on its left edge, so pick it rarely (it reads as a bay end).
//
// Decor anchor is the bottom left (y is the top of the floor row it stands
// on). Light sources, in decor pixels from the top left: studyLamp the bulb
// under the green shade at (7, 14), its pool on the table top row 21;
// studyTable none; window the campus lamp outside at (31, 29); goalWindow
// the panes, centre about (16, 24), and the lamp's reflection at (21, 31);
// quietSign the lightbox, centre (24, 7). goalWindow (the goal): 4 frames of
// a slow pulse (the halo grows, the horizon haze lifts, the sill warms),
// loop. quietSign: the breakable sign in this theme, frame 0 on, frame 1
// flicker (like neonSign).
//
// LIBRARY_GLOW lists the keys that glow: E bulb, F warm lamp light, G amber
// pool, H green glow at the shade rim, R lit windows outside, S moon,
// T U the aura sigma, X warm halo, Y green halo, Z faint warm halo.
//
// LIBRARY_BACKDROP: three 512 px tileable strips for the parallax, bottom
// row opaque (repeat it downward to lift a strip): far (112: the deep stacks
// receding on two levels, aisle lamp pools, the coffered ceiling dark), mid
// (96: atrium balconies with glass railings, reading tables and green
// lamps, downlights in the soffits, two columns and the central stair; clear
// between the slabs so far shows through), near (64: the closest stack ends
// and a balcony railing, dark). There is no sky: paint `fill` above the
// strips (it matches the far strip's top rows).
